{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792292700, "covers_from": "2026-10-18T03:05:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-18T03:06:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792292760, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-18T03:05:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 66832, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我感覺整個台北市規劃紅線的區域越來越多，而且紅線的規定有特別嚴格「不能臨時停車」容易被檢舉，希望市長", "display_name": "文山代表 No.66,832", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T03:05:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9275, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "未必是車多才擠塞。有時是一條路短短兩個燈位，一個才轉綠，駛到下一個仍然是紅。走走停停，車流變慢。", "display_name": "士林代表 Raymond 鄺", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T03:05:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 15269, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "大樓有非法之日租套房，除了打打1999檢舉外，還有什麼有效率的方式？謝謝  \n希望下一任市長是沈伯洋", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.15,269", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T03:05:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 20489, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "老房子太多，頂加很醜，台北市市容又老又醜，希望能改善，歐美也有很多老房子，市容卻是有美感", "display_name": "大同代表 No.20,489", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 9275, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 Raymond 鄺", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 15269, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.15,269", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 20489, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.20,489", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 61147, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "displa